      propertyPath: 'tutorialMessages.Array.data[3]'
      value: Your bullet will land where the light shows
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5244568340785563921, guid: 4395ae371e1c8184989acbb800f29f69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'tutorialMessages.Array.data[4]'
      value: You can charge your magic to inflict more damage. Hold left click and
